<main id="content" class="site-main page mt-classic"><div class="page-header"><h1 class="entry-title">Custom Reflection Pools And Fountains By Midwest Tropical</h1></div><div class="page-content"><p>Reflection pools and indoor water fountains are wonderful ways to add ambiance and elegance to all kinds of spaces. Whether you are talking about a luxury hotel, an airport concourse, a commercial building, a casino lobby or a private home, adding a fountain means bringing the beauty and sounds of nature right to the place where you work or live. Likewise, installing a reflection pool gives you the sweet serenity of shallow, undisturbed water, even indoors. Because of this, the two features often go together  particularly in loud or high-traffic areas where they can counterbalance the noise. At Midwest Tropical, many of our fountains include a reflecting pool design, which allows falling water to gracefully pour from the fountain into the larger, serene pool that makes the entire water feature even more enticing and enchanting. To give you the best in reflecting pools and fountains, we are proud to offer the option to custom-design your water features to perfectly complete the overall look of your environment. Talk to our professionals about creating a one-of-a-kind focal point that caters to your environment.</p><h2>Custom Reflection Pools And Fountains From Midwest Tropical</h2><p>Calm and soothing, custom fountains and reflection pools nicely counteract high-traffic areas in offices, resorts, transportation facilities, casinos and more. When you place one between a property entrance and an architectural feature or visual focal point, the water fountain becomes a way to add impressive visual drama. With this in mind, Midwest Tropical custom-creates reflecting pools and fountains for businesses and residences around the country. Because we design and build each unit individually, our custom indoor water features can come in any shape imaginable. Whether you want to line your wall with a reflection pool and fountain or wish to create a focal point at your facility, our team can do it. Thanks to the peaceful impact of our reflecting pools, you cant go wrong adding one to your space. To further enhance their appeal, many of our designs combine a reflection pool with another of our water features  such as a cascading fountain, tranquil rain curtain or unique <a href="/waterwalls/">Aquafall Water Wall</a>. No matter which design you choose, adding a reflection pool can create the ultimate  factor.</p><p><a href="/gallery/"><br /><picture><source srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-50x50.webp 50w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-100x100.jpg.webp 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-150x84.jpg.webp 150w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-300x168.jpg.webp 300w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-380x213.jpg.webp 380w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-480x269.jpg.webp 480w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1.jpg 570w" type="image/webp"><img decoding="async" width="570" height="320" src="/wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1.jpg" alt="Gallery Banner 1" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-50x50.webp 50w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-100x100.jpg 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-150x84.jpg 150w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-300x168.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-380x213.jpg 380w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1-480x269.jpg 480w, /wp-content/uploads/Gallery-Banner-1.jpg 570w" sizes="(max-width: 570px) 100vw, 570px" title="Reflection Pools &amp; Fountains 1" data-mtfi="1"></picture></a><br /><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" width="2560" height="1920" src="/wp-content/uploads/Reflection-Pool-with-Bubbler-Fountain-Jets-at-Embassy-Suites-Milpitas-San-Jose-California-Copy-1-jpg.avif" alt="Reflection Pool with Bubbler Fountain Jets at Embassy Suites Milpitas (San Jose) California - Copy" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/Reflection-Pool-with-Bubbler-Fountain-Jets-at-Embassy-Suites-Milpitas-San-Jose-California-Copy-1-jpg-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/Reflection-Pool-with-Bubbler-Fountain-Jets-at-Embassy-Suites-Milpitas-San-Jose-California-Copy-1-jpg-768x576.avif 768w, /wp-content/uploads/Reflection-Pool-with-Bubbler-Fountain-Jets-at-Embassy-Suites-Milpitas-San-Jose-California-Copy-1-jpg-800x600.avif 800w, /wp-content/uploads/Reflection-Pool-with-Bubbler-Fountain-Jets-at-Embassy-Suites-Milpitas-San-Jose-California-Copy-1-jpg-1440x1080.avif 1440w, /wp-content/uploads/Reflection-Pool-with-Bubbler-Fountain-Jets-at-Embassy-Suites-Milpitas-San-Jose-California-Copy-1-jpg.avif 1600w, /wp-content/uploads/Reflection-Pool-with-Bubbler-Fountain-Jets-at-Embassy-Suites-Milpitas-San-Jose-California-Copy-1-jpg.avif 2400w, /wp-content/uploads/Reflection-Pool-with-Bubbler-Fountain-Jets-at-Embassy-Suites-Milpitas-San-Jose-California-Copy-1-jpg.avif 2560w" sizes="(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px" title="Reflection Pools &amp; Fountains 2" data-mtfi="1"></p><h2>Midwest Tropical The Leader In Custom-Reflecting Pool And Fountain Design</h2><p>When it comes to building a <a href="/water-features/">custom water feature</a> in your facility, there are many companies from which to choose, but only Midwest Tropical is able to stake a claim as the pioneer of the water wall and the bubble wall. Because we invented these water features, we understand how to make and install them properly. We got our start helping doctors service their custom fish tanks and found that many practitioners wanted the relaxing and soothing effects of an aquarium without the costly and time-consuming upkeep. This led us to develop the industry first bubble walls: all the tranquility of indoor water features, with none of the headaches. From there, we launched our <a href="/gallery/">custom indoor water fountain</a> business. Today, Midwest Tropical designs, builds and installs our custom water fountains and reflection pools throughout the nation. Every piece we install is made here in the United States from our Chicago-area facility. We also offer turn-key service to quickly get your water feature up and running. With the help of our in-house design team, we can turn your ideas into reality as we build your custom water feature.</p><h2>Get Your Free Quote Today</h2><p>Are you ready to give your home, office, clinic, hotel, casino, business or other facility a truly impressive look? <a href="/contact-us-2/">Contact Midwest Tropical</a> today for your free quote for an indoor wall fountain. Whether you are interested in custom fountains, reflecting pool designs or our <a href="/bubble-walls/">signature bubble walls</a>, our team will embrace your ideas for your space and turn them into the custom look you desire.</p><h2>Reflection Pool and Fountain Gallery</h2>
